# Licensed source texts are kept byte-for-byte (Tanzil: "changing it is not allowed")
data-sources/** -text
# Mosque packs: their sizes and sha256 are recorded in the pack index and SOURCE.md, so keep them byte-for-byte
public/data/mosques/** -text
